# Gear sets to compare with your current gear (restoration_druid_sim.bat passes this file to SimC with tolerance=1).
# One SimC profileset per set: profileset."Name"+=<profile line>, one line per change, the lines from the SimC addon
# export ("Gear from Bags"). Each set is your current gear with these lines swapped in. Add ilevel=<n> to an item to
# compare it at another item level. Two lines with one name = a combination. An empty file compares nothing.
# BiS (2026-11-13): every season 2 raid, Mythic+ and crafted item simmed at its max item level (trinkets, weapons, neck
# 341; the rest 334; Coiled Altar and Ula'tek drops 344; crafted 337 at most). Only these beat your current gear.
# Already answered and dropped: Ouroboric Signet (Vile Band right), bag Lunar Raiment (same), Sigil (below Seastone
# next to Gebbo's Bag), Twin Fangs (downgrade), every other ring, neck, weapon, off hand and armor piece (same or worse).

# The one new item: Gebbo's Bottomless Bag (Lost Explorers) for Hex Lord's Dooming Idol
profileset."Gebbo's Bottomless Bag 341 for Hex Lord's Dooming Idol"+=trinket1=,id=270164,ilevel=341

# Upgrades of what you wear (Coiled Altar and Ula'tek drops go to 344)
profileset."Sash of the Forlorn Vessel upgraded to 344"+=waist=,id=268256,gem_id=240900,bonus_id=6652/13696/13662/13334/12854/13695,ilevel=344
profileset."Jan'thrazet upgraded to 344"+=main_hand=,id=271092,enchant_id=8689,bonus_id=6652/13334/12856,ilevel=344
profileset."Silken Voodoo Drape upgraded to 344"+=back=,id=268253,bonus_id=41/13662/13334/12854,ilevel=344
profileset."Aqirbane Reliquary upgraded to 344"+=neck=,id=268265,gem_id=240983/240900,bonus_id=6652/13668/13334/13987/12856,ilevel=344

